          <key>date</key>
          <string>2015-11-04</string>
          <key>inference</key>
          <string>The intended base+0486+0301 iso uses an interacting side-by-side breathing/accent arrangement, with the acute at the breathing mark's right. The reversed-order examples and generic vertical stacking are distinct. A vertical separation-only criterion would accept the wrong typographic result.</string>
          <key>pdf</key>
